   "id": "el002-7"
  }
 ],
 "intro": {
  "@es": "Además del aspecto, podrás explicar con frases sencillas cómo es una persona y comparar dos rasgos.",
  "@en": "In addition to the look, you can explain with simple phrases what a person is and compare two features."
 }
